			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1506497">
									

<p>I'm not sure diseases could really be transferred between humans and HEs. I'm not a biologist or anything, but my understanding is that most diseases are specifically tailored to a particular species' cells and biology, and can't usually be transferred even to other terrestrial species, let alone weird extra-terrestrial ones, potentially with completely different biology.</p>
<p>Still, the “learning from history” thing is a great idea, and I'm upvoting.</p>

