			<div class="content" id="post-content-1561204">
									

<p>And SCPs.</p>
<p>To go more to the topic, it isn't confirmed as possible. And I don't know how many of you have noticed, our propulsion research hasnt been very staggering. We are just now building rockets that can do what the Saturn Vs did. And as for alternate forms of propulsion (FTL isn't necessarily impossible, but it isn't effective with a slow acceleration rate), well I haven't seen any results that we can use. 50 years isn't a long time. I'm thinking it'd take more than that.</p>

							</div>

								
					
