																		Lessons from History
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/toadking07" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1632267); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1632267&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608973867" alt="toadking07" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1632267)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/toadking07" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1632267); return false;" >toadking07</a></span> <span class="odate time_1374344357 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">20 Jul 2013 18:19</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1818317">
									

<p>This is an interesting read nonethelss, but it seems to not really touch upon Foundation issues. I mean, we have various subjects/items that suggest we are/were not alone or that something, demonic/alien/alternative reality, is trying to invade us.</p>
<p>In short I'd love to see this tied to either a specific scip, set of scips, or just the scips in general and discus it more. Learning from history would help us in an alien invasion, but what about any active invasions we have already in progress?</p>

							</div>

								
					
